message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Rendering-Free Event Frame Simulation for Fast Reinforcement Learning of Autonomous Robot Navigation"
abstract: >-
  An analytic event-camera simulator that synthesizes calibrated event observations directly
  from scene geometry and ego-motion, without rendering, and the reinforcement-learning
  pipeline that trains goal-directed obstacle avoidance on top of it.
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous (under review)"
year: 2027
license: MIT
